  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Mini croissant platter turns your table into an instant gathering spot, piled high with buttery, flaky crescents ready for sweet and savory fillings. Stuff them with herbed cream cheese and smoked turkey, scoop in chicken salad, or go sweet with strawberry jam and mascarpone for a soft, dreamy bite. Fresh basil, a light honey drizzle, or a sprinkle of herbs adds a little extra sparkle without extra work. Perfect for brunch or parties, this mini croissant platter is effortless to assemble, easy to customize, and guaranteed to disappear fast.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-mini-croissant-platter\">Why You’ll Love This Mini croissant platter</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-mini-croissant-platter\">How to Make Mini Croissant Platter</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-mini-croissant-platter\">Pro Tips for Making Mini Croissant Platter</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-mini-croissant-platter\">How to Serve this Mini Croissant Platter</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-mini-croissant-platter\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Mini croissant platter</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfect for any occasion, from brunch to parties.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable fillings to suit every taste—sweet or savory!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to prepare, making you the star of the gathering.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Impressive presentation that will wow your guests.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-8578\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"8578\" data-servings=\"12\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"533\" height=\"300\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Delicious-Mini-Croissant-Platter.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"A mini croissant platter with various fillings and garnished with fresh fruits and herbs.\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Delicious-Mini-Croissant-Platter.webp 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Delicious-Mini-Croissant-Platter-300x169.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Delicious-Mini-Croissant-Platter-1024x576.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Delicious-Mini-Croissant-Platter-768x432.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Delicious-Mini-Croissant-Platter-480x270.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 533px) 100vw, 533px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">Mini croissant platter</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal\">Delight your guests with a Mini croissant platter! This easy recipe is perfect for parties and brunches. 🥐✨</div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style